  <page_number>286</page_number>
  <running_head>EMBLEMATA ET</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">Ver nouum vestit, recoquente Cancro</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">Aureas messes, bona dum rubentes</l>
    <l n="3">Libra dat vuas.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">Ætheris blandos generas calores,</l>
    <l n="5">Vita quèis toti venit alma mundo:</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">Aëris campos liquidi, fluenta</l>
    <l n="7">Ducis &amp; vndæ.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Te patrem tellus vocat, &amp; potenti</l>
    <l n="9">Dexterâ se scit medio locatam</l>
    <l n="10">Orbe: quò nusquam quatiatur vllis</l>
    <l n="11">Viribus acta.</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">Illius clausos referas meatus,</l>
    <l n="13">Stirpibus cunctis venit inde viuax</l>
    <l n="14">Humor, &amp; sese Zephyri resoluit</l>
    <l n="15">Gleba tepore.</l>
    <l n="16" para="true">Colles pampineis vitibus obsiti,</l>
    <l n="17">Indi lætitia percelebres patris,</l>
    <l n="18">Apricis soliti solibus excoqui,</l>
    <l n="19">Summo ferte Deo quàle petit decus:</l>
    <l n="20">Cuius cuncta vigent munere viuido.</l>
    <l n="21" para="true">Montes perpetuâ qui niue candidi,</l>
    <l n="22">Et crystalligenis rupibus asperi,</l>
    <l n="23">Horretis Boreæ flatibus algidis,</l>
    <l n="24">Eia ferte Deo cantica: nam gelu</l>
    <l n="25">Ostendit validæ robora dexteræ.</l>
    <l n="26" para="true">Montes aëriis nubibus additi,</l>
    <l n="27">Non vllis hominum (nil quibus auium)</l>
    <l n="28">Assueti pedibus, vix penetrabiles</l>
    <l n="29">Ipsis montigenis hospitibus feris,</l>
    <l n="30">Dum sublime caput conditis æthere,</l>
    <l n="31">Laudes ætherei tollite Iehouæ,</l>
    <l n="32">Frænantis validó robore dexteræ</l>
    <l n="33">Nubes arbitrij temperie sui.</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Scan is faded; line-final words and some letters (e.g. "Ver nouum", "quò") are uncertain. Show-through from the reverse page at the right edge was ignored. Numerous small marks and specks in the margins are not text.</notes>
